  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gas to Industry Virtual Pipeline Project, through Nearshore Natural Gas, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to Tombia River Energy Company funds a feasibility study (FS) for a virtual pipeline gas transportation project that will compress gas and transport it via trucks to customers for power and feedstock in the Niger Delta region of Nigeria. The project will deliver up to 50 million standard cubic feet per day (MMSCFD) of gas to customers in the region and will support the goals of Nigeria&apos;s Economic Recovery and Growth Plan by supporting diversification of the country&apos;s energy industry. The Study will be undertaken on a sole source basis by the U.S. firm, Nearshore Natural Gas.</narrative>
  </description>
